        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 819CMH, Dummy Camino Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nModern Deco styled design, the Kwikset Camino Dummy Handleset has concealed screw mounts for a super sleek look. By making something that have could been too simple into something that looks chic, the sleek design of this  handleset exemplifies the modern deco design aesthetic. The Kwikset Dummy Camino Handleset is not functional as it neither latches nor locks; it is most often used on the inactive side of double doors as a pull to match trim. Backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty the Camino handle is available in 5 color options. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/jackson-J-190_size.gif?v=1704354515\" width\"450\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Kwikset Camino Dummy Handleset Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-camino-handleset-kwikset-818cmh\"><b>Single Cylinder Camino Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications & Features</b> for the Kwikset Camino Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 17-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt: Adjustable, Min: 8-13/32 - Max: 9-11/16</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed, Reversible for Left or Right handing</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDummy handlesets are for looks only. They do not lock and do not latch. They are used as a pull or to match trim on the inactive side of double doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim finish will match the exterior handleset finish that you choose.</i><br>\r\n<b>*Vedani Lever NOT available in 514 Iron Black Finish</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Dummy Camino Handleset, Kwikset 819CMH",
                "description": "Kwikset 819CMH - Modern Deco styled design, the Kwikset Camino Dummy Handleset has concealed screw mounts for a super sleek look. By making something that have could been too simple into something that looks chic, the sleek design of this  handleset exemplifies the modern deco design aesthetic. The Kwikset Dummy Camino Handleset is not functional as it neither latches nor locks; it is most often used on the inactive side of double doors as a pull to match trim. Backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty the Camino handle is available in 5 color options.",
